silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_03_negative_regression_catalog_yoneda_hom_leg_2 silm:hasExample "In 'YonedaHomLeg — 03_negative_regression_catalog #2', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, TSN 183798 → TaxonIdentifier → TypeSeed → D_Mittens is the required factorization for regression k2." .
